  "description": "<h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Round Rattan Tray with Mother-of-Pearl Inlay: Timeless Elegance &amp; Artisanal Luxury</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">As demand grows for high-end eco-friendly home decor, products combining natural fibers with organic luxury finishes continue to drive global sales. We are proud to introduce our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"179\">Handcrafted Round Rattan Tray with Mother-of-Pearl (MOP) Inlay</b>, a exquisite piece designed to bring coastal elegance and artisan craft into modern living spaces.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Selling Points &amp; Product Features</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Premium Natural &amp; Eco-Friendly Materials</b> Crafted from durable, fast-growing natural rattan and ethically sourced mother-of-pearl (MOP) shell tiles. This piece offers a luxury alternative to synthetic, plastic, or plain wooden trays.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Exquisite Artisan Craftsmanship</b> Every single tray is painstakingly handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans. Key design highlights include:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inlaid Shell Base:</b> The interior surface features hand-placed mother-of-pearl mosaic tiles forming a shimmering ivory backdrop, detailed with delicate green four-leaf clover motifs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hand-Woven Rattan Frame:</b> Sturdy, tightly coiled rattan rim that provides structural durability and organic warmth.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Built-In Cutout Handles:</b> Ergonomically designed woven handles for effortless carrying and serving.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Versatile Functionality &amp; Styling</b></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decorative Tray:</b> Accent piece on ottomans, coffee tables, dressers, or dining sideboards.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Serving Tray:</b> Elegant vessel for drinks, tea, breakfast, or appetizers during gatherings.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vanity &amp; Organizer:</b> Keeps perfumes, jewelry, cosmetics, or candles organized in style.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Impact: Empowering Communities &amp; Preserving Heritage</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Your sourcing partnership creates direct social impact in Vietnamese craft communities:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Creation for Rural Artisans:</b> Rattan harvesting, processing, and intricate shell-inlay work provide stable livelihoods and fair wages for local farmers and rural craftspeople.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Traditional Heritage:</b> Vietnam has centuries of expertise in lacquerware and mother-of-pearl inlay techniques. Exporting these handcrafted trays sustains local craft villages and keeps traditional arts thriving.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">OEM / ODM &amp; Custom Manufacturing Solutions</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">We offer full customization flexibility to meet your target market requirements:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Inlay Patterns &amp; Colors:</b> Modify shell mosaic motifs (floral, geometric, herringbone) and shell colors (natural white, pearl, green, blue, black MOP).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dimensions &amp; Shapes:</b> Custom diameters, depths, or alternative shapes (rectangular, oval, square).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Private Labeling &amp; Packaging:</b> Laser-engraved logos, custom barcode tags, drop-test protective e-commerce packaging, and retail-ready gift boxes.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner with Us Today</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">Elevate your home decor catalog with handcrafted luxury items from Vietnam.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">📩 <b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact Us Today</b> to request product catalogs, sample units, or competitive FOB wholesale quotations!</p>",
